NOTES:

Any of these can combine. 1 + 8 gives you the Greys and then the Bridge. 3 + 10 gives you loneliness above and ancient power below. 2 + 9 gives you the people Dusty and Evangelise left behind framing the people they're about to meet. 7 weaves into anything as connective tissue.

The question is where the camera points first — and therefore what the reader cares about before they know they should.
